{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17437","headline":"数名诗 · 权德舆","name":"数名诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一区杨雄宅，恬然无所欲。\n二顷季子田，岁晏常自足。\n三端固爲累，事物反徽束。\n四体苟不动，安得丰菽粟。\n五侯诚暐晔，荣甚或爲辱。\n六翮未骞翔，虞罗乃相触。\n七人称作者，杳杳有遐躅。\n八桂挺奇姿，森森照初旭。\n九歌伤泽畔，怨思徒刺促。\n十翼有格言，幽贞谢浮俗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17437.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17437","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}